== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Upon use, copies the effect of the [[card]] or [[rune]] currently held by Isaac.
* {{dlc|r}} Upon use, copies the effect of the [[card]] currently held by Isaac. Blank Card's recharge time changes upon use, depending on the card Isaac was holding when he used it.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|anr}} Blank card also mimics {{p|Dice Shard}} and {{p|Emergency Contact}}.{{dlc-}}
* Using Blank Card does not expend the consumable.
* Using the Blank Card with a consumable that isn't compatible, or no consumable at all, spends the charge with no effect.
* If holding more than one consumable (e.g. {{I|Starter Deck}}, Tainted Characters...), only the consumable that is selected will be used. If one of them isn't a card, they must ensure the card is the one selected when activating Blank Card, otherwise the effect won't be triggered.

