== Trivia ==
* This item is a card counterpart to {{i|Placebo}} and {{i|Clear Rune}}.
* {{p|? Card}} sending Isaac to the {{r|I AM ERROR}} room and destroying both items is a nod to how the combination acting as expected would create an infinite loop, as the two items would attempt to use each other infinitely.

